# MOFs-functionalized regenerable SERS sensor based on electrochemistry for pretreatment-free detection of serum alkaline phosphatase activity

a Key Laboratory for Advanced Materials, Shanghai Key Laboratory of Functional Materials Chemistry, Joint International Laboratory for Precision Chemistry, Frontiers Science Center for Materiobiology & Dynamic Chemistry, School of Chemistry and Molecular Engineering, East China University of Science and Technology, Shanghai 200237, PR China   
